# CR 727 (restarting the game), ADR-0034, karn_liberated.txt:7. Karn's -14
# shuffles every card in every player's battlefield, library, graveyard, hand
# and exile into its owner's library -- except non-Aura permanent cards
# exiled with Karn, which stay in exile (RestrictFromZone$ Exile |
# RestrictFromValid$ Card.!ExiledWithSource,Spell,Card.Aura) -- then
# SubAbility$ ReturnFromExile puts those onto the battlefield under Karn's
# controller. The ai's Grizzly Bears (ExiledWith:1) come back under human's
# control; the Llanowar Elves exiled by something else, the Forest, the
# Bolt and Karn itself all end up in their owners' libraries, and life
# resets to 20.
startturn human
advance 3
queue action human activate 1 2
passpriority
# The priority round returns on the restart (Game.Restarted). The restarted
# game deals opening hands from the reset libraries with no coin flip or
# second shuffle, runs mulligans starting with Karn's controller, and begins
# human's first turn. expect.state's hand order is the harness's seed-1
# shuffle of each reset library.
queue keephand true
queue keephand true
resumerestart
